# Raw data is never in this repo. See DATA.md.
*.RDS
*.rds
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.h5ad

# Big rendered artwork: the SVGs are committed, the Illustrator files are not.
*.ai
*.eps

# OS and editor noise
.DS_Store
~$*
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/

# Regenerated panels. run_all.R writes SVGs into analysis/<Fig N>/nc_panels/,
# so without this a clone becomes dirty the first time anyone reproduces the
# figures. The reference renders are committed under figures/ instead.
analysis/**/nc_panels/
